      "DIFFICULTY_EXPLANATION": "The task is difficult because ten differentiated Terraform lifecycles share identity, state-transition, mutation-runner, native-observation and normalization invariants; failures fan out across filesystem, content, account and cron resources rather than reducing to isolated stubs.",
